Comment:
 s5066d and s5066-test ship as self-contained single-file executables that
 bundle the .NET runtime and libraries (Copyright .NET Foundation and
 Contributors, MIT licence).
 .
 s5066d links pdn-soundmodem for its radio medium (a sound card, CM108 PTT and a
 busy detector). pdn-soundmodem is AGPL-3.0-or-later with some parts
 GPL-3.0-or-later or GPL-3.0-only, so this binary is distributed under the
 AGPL-3.0-or-later combined with those GPL-3.0 terms, which AGPL section 13 and
 GPL section 13 allow. It is not available under the commercial licence that
 the libraries M0LTE.S5066.Core, Host and Client are also offered under.
 s5066-test links only the Client library.
 .
 Other bundled components: pdn-soundmodem's own dependencies (M0LTE.Dsp,
 M0LTE.Fec, M0LTE.Ms110d and others, AGPL-3.0-or-later; M0LTE.Il2p,
 GPL-3.0-or-later). Their licence texts are distributed with their upstream
 sources.

